{"id":"bolo","lemma":"bolo","pos":"noun","rank":993,"glosses":["dessert made with dough and sugar; common in celebrations","any of various snacks made with dough, both sweet and salty","bunch, heap, mass (load of some material or of beings)"],"ipa":"/ˈbo.lu/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"bolos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/85/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Nelson_Ricardo_2500-bolo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Eu quero um bolo.","en":"I want a cake.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1272352","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"querer"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Quem quer um pouco de bolo?","en":"Who wants a bit of cake?","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"to want","l":"querer"},null,null,{"g":"of / from"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"slightly"]]},{"text":"Minha mãe sabe fazer bolos.","en":"My mother knows how to make cakes.","words":[{"g":"my, mine","l":"meu"},{"g":"mother"},{"g":"to be aware, to know","l":"saber"},{"g":"to create"},null]},{"text":"Quem fez este bolo?","en":"Who made this cake?","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"to create","l":"fazer"},{"g":"this"},null]},{"text":"Havia dois bolos.","en":"There were two cakes.","words":[{"g":"there be","l":"haver"},{"g":"deuce"},null]}]}